WEBVTT

00:00:02.090 --> 00:00:03.820
Summer holidays at last-pri!

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:05.580
We can put on heaps of shows!

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:06.140
Indeed.

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:09.730
We'll have a blast this summer!

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:15.400
I hope we can have fun as well.
If only Hibiki-san had the same enthusiasm...

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.840
Your Maho-chan's more of a Maho-can't at the moment.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.780
That reminds me: what's Falulu doing?

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.520
Falulu...

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:27.020
is helping Garuru study.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:29.690
Hibiki-san's busy with acting work.

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:30.540
Tell us about your latest work...

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:31.800
What should we look out for?

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.280
They're really giving it their all.

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:37.470
What's that?

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:39.970
Hey, it's a bottle.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.700
And there's a letter inside it.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:46.620
No fooling, a letter in a bottle?

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:48.320
Neat how it doesn't get wet.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:49.640
I wonder who sent it?

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:53.780
"SOS"...

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:56.110
"From the Sapanna PriPara"?

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:58.300
Oh no! It's an SOS!

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.260
We have to help them!

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.820
It could just be a prank, you know-pri?

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:05.040
But what if they're really in trouble?

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:07.440
Okay, but where even is this "Sapanna"?

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:08.500
Good question...

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:10.480
PriPara-ding-dong!

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:16.970
The scheduled pleasure cruise to Sapanna PriPara Town will be departing momentarily!

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:18.720
Hey, she said Sapanna!

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:18.730
Excuse me, we'd like to get on!
Hey, she said Sapanna!

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:20.970
Excuse me, we'd like to get on!

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:22.690
Hold on a moment, Lala!

00:01:22.690 --> 00:01:24.370
I guess we're going as well!

00:01:24.370 --> 00:01:25.230
Yeah!

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:30.520
I've never been on a Japanese houseboat before.

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:32.330
I'm getting pretty psyched!

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:33.010
Me too!

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:36.360
We're now setting off for Sapanna PriPara Port!

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:37.860
Go!

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:43.630
What kind of pleasure cruise is this?

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:45.250
This is pri darn fast for a houseboat!

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:47.440
We're gonna crash!

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:51.490
So that was a drawbridge, then?

00:01:51.490 --> 00:01:53.130
Why're <i>you</i> all calm?

00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:55.870
This speed is pri-diculous!

00:01:55.870 --> 00:01:57.900
Look, the scenery's changing before our eyes.

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:01.400
It's a waterfall!

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:02.910
What?

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:05.680
We'll pass over some rough water soon,
so please do hold on.

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:11.950
Capisce!

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:13.640
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:16.100
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:19.970
Keep winning through the Divine Idol Grand Prix and become a Divine Idol!

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:22.490
All the other idols are amazing, but I won't give up!

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:24.560
Cheer me on, everyone!

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:08.180
We've arrived at Sapanna PriPara Town!

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:10.520
Thank you for sailing with us today!

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.460
Man, we're finally here.

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:13.610
My head's still spinning-pri.

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:14.840
I'm exhausted...

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:16.260
That was horrible.

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:17.010
Yeah...

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:21.040
Just how you'd expect Aprica to be.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:22.620
It looks quite overgrown.

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:24.380
I'm amazed...

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:26.040
how those two are so energetic.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.220
They're like superwomen-pri.

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:29.660
Whoa! It's a hippo!

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.440
Look, there are elephants and giraffes!

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:41.260
That's a shoebill.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:42.970
They're quite docile-pri.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:46.890
This... is PriPara?

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:49.660
It looks pri run down, but it's definitely PriPara.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:51.310
This is the fountain square-pri.

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.830
They look to have been quite sturdy buildings.

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:56.600
Indeed, in the past it would have been flourishing.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:58.180
Lu-lu-lu-lu-lu-lu...

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:02.510
It looks like the stage system isn't working either.

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:05.280
Are Meganee or Meganii around-pri?

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:07.570
Hm?

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:09.200
What's this thing?

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:13.310
I don't get it.

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:17.260
It's a herd of gnus! Run for it!

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:19.460
Hey, little gnus!

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.240
Please stop!

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:26.630
Good gnus.

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:30.350
Wel-come.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:33.760
To the branch off-ice of the ori-ginal Pri-Para,

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:37.250
the Aprican Sa-panna Pri-Para.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:42.020
I am Sapanee, from the Sa-panna Town!

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.420
"Sapanee"?

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:45.410
Um...

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:49.120
Your fractured speech doesn't inspire confidence-pri,

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.700
not to mention that leopard-patterned one piece...

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:55.710
I haven't talked to hu-mans in so long,

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:58.500
I've for-gotten how to speak pro-perly.

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:01.230
Over there is Sapanii.

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:04.970
He keeps him-self bu-sy with the chim-pan-zees,

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:07.470
or the chim-par-ty!

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:11.870
Ook, eek. Ook-ook!

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:15.890
And <i>he</i> no longer speaks a human tongue.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:21.660
Are you girls may-be Pri-Para i-dols?

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:23.610
Yes, we came here from Parajuku.

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:26.070
It was after we found this letter.

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:29.050
Did you send this letter, Sapanee-san?

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:33.690
I don't re-mem-ber see-ing this.

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:37.630
I wonder who sent it, then?

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:41.540
Hm?

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:43.390
Say, there's someone over there.

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:47.260
It's okay; we won't hurt you.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:48.410
Come on out!

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:54.170
I was the one...

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:56.170
who sent the letter.

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:57.860
Hanana-chan!

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:02.530
Um, my name is Panana.

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:06.400
Thank you so much for coming!

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:08.700
She looks just like Hanana-chan...

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.310
So, um, Panana-chan,

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:13.600
what was the SOS about-pri?

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:15.560
I got this photo from my grandma.

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.700
It's an old photo of PriPara.

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:22.250
My grandma was always telling me...

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:25.200
about how PriPara here, too,

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:28.910
was always full of idols and excitement.

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:34.810
But at some point all the people left.

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:36.420
Now it's as you can see.

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:41.880
So I want to bring PriPara back to how it was in my grandma's stories,

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.980
and make this town full of dreams again!

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:48.510
I wanted to ask someone to help,

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:50.750
and no one is around here at all.

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.440
I think I com-pri-hend.

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:56.370
I got a PriTicket as well,

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:59.100
but I haven't been able to snap it with anyone.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:00.340
No way...

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:03.120
Then you should snap with me!

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.410
What? No, I couldn't...

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:08.540
I only have the one PriTicket, you see...

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:11.470
And there's a girl I want to snap it with.

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:13.390
Really? What kind of girl is she?

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:29.190
So this is the Sapanna Prism Stone?

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:32.350
That was a pretty lame clothes-changing there.

00:08:32.350 --> 00:08:35.910
Wow, you all look so different as well!

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:39.330
So these is Sapanna Town...

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:43.170
This is my school.

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:47.420
So who's the girl you want to snap Friend Tickets with?

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:49.040
The girl in the middle there.

00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:51.370
Her name's Amiya.

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:52.760
Hm? "Amiya"?

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:53.950
I know!

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:54.350
Right?

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:56.450
A... mi...

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.180
I feel... as though...

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:01.560
I've seen that girl somewhere before...

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:02.580
<i>Pri!</i>

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:04.060
<i>... and I've gotcha!</i>

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:06.010
You should go and snap with her!

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:07.760
U–Um, but...

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:09.280
Oh, hello.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:11.880
Where did you come from?

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:13.690
Amiya-chan!

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:17.310
Oh, is she a friend of yours, Panana?

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:21.740
Panana's kind of a weirdo, so come play with us.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:28.450
Panana thinks there's some shining place in there,
where heaps of idols sing and dance.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.570
She says it's called "PriPara"!

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:34.850
It's just some weird ruin filled with animals.

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:38.940
My mum says it's really dangerous, so make sure you never go in there.

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:40.580
Um...

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:44.350
These girls are real PriPara idols, you see!

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:47.160
I didn't make PriPara up; it really–

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:47.880
Panana.

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:51.290
Would you hurry up and open your eyes?

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:54.760
You're such a little kid, Panana.

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.960
For sure. You coming, Amiya?

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:57.550
See ya.

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:01.200
What ill-tempered brats!

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.730
Especially that Amiya...

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:06.790
I wish I could turn a deaf ear to her,
but for some reason she gets under my skin.

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:09.900
I can't believe they don't believe in PriPara.

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:11.290
That's so sad.

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:15.160
All right, Panana-chan.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:19.860
Let's go make PriPara sparkle again and bring Amiya and her friends!

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:23.220
You'll be able to snap PriTickets as well!

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:25.400
Lala-chan!

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:30.820
I do want to help out.

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:33.960
Hey, you don't mean...

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:37.490
We'll clean this place up so we can perform!

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:38.860
Oi, you serious?

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:40.600
An ant's thoughts reach Heaven

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:43.680
Nothing is out of reach of determined effort.

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:44.280
Right!

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:46.480
Okay, that clinches it-pri!

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:47.600
Oh, but...

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:51.150
It'll be fine. Just have faith in us PriPara idols.

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:53.250
We'll perform here, no matter what!

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:57.800
Your job's to convince Amiya-chan and the other girls to come here.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:00.190
O... Okay then!

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:03.760
Hey, that's right.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:06.720
Lala-chan, there's one animal you have to look out for!

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:08.960
An animal?

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:09.620
Yeah!

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:13.470
There's a lion wearing red glasses.

00:11:13.470 --> 00:11:17.280
It's a ferocious lion that won't let anyone approach.

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:20.820
A lion wearing red glasses, right?

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:21.570
That's right!

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:23.720
Okay, got it!

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:44.990
Pushu...

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:49.700
What?

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:52.810
<i>This</i> is the PriPara stage?

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.700
It's just as bad on the inside.

00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:58.360
First we fix up the stage so we can perform!

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.400
Commence cleaning!

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:02.560
A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step!

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:03.630
Capisce!

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:08.540
These weeds are nothing to ol' Dorothy!

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:11.000
They're putting up a good fight, though.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.680
Dorothy, behind you...

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:13.920
Ulp.

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:18.370
Oh, little lizard.

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:20.140
You shouldn't surprise people like that.

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:24.530
Pri-peat after me.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:28.460
Scan the appro-pri-ate number of tickets for your coord.

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:31.210
Starting the coord change-pri.

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:32.340
Now you-pri.

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:36.780
Scan the... num-ber... tick-ets... pri?

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:40.030
Ook, ook, eek!

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:41.060
Hold it right there-pri!

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:44.360
The chim-party is off-limits until you pri-gain your language skills!

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:46.910
Ook-eek! Ook-eek!

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:48.900
You must pri-call it!

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:53.370
Meganii's job isn't raising chimpanzees-pri!

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:55.170
It's raising idols-pri!

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.510
Pri!

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:00.380
And… cut! And… cut!

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:08.550
Hey, get your dirty paws off where I just cleaned!

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:11.700
This looks good!

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:15.360
Done and done! Restored to its former glory!

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:17.470
The stage system is ready to go!

00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:18.140
Yeah!

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:21.650
Now Panana-chan just has to bring Amiya-chan!

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:22.300
Hm?

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:25.240
Huh? Now it's you, Reona?

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:26.910
Hm? No, it's not...

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:29.290
Hey, Dorothy, behind you!

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:33.040
A–A lion wearing red glasses!

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:40.240
Little lion!

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:41.730
Fuwari! It's too dangerous!

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:42.380
Hold on!

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:52.990
Not even Fuwari can calm this beast!

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:56.690
It's a ferocious lion that w–won't let anyone approach, remember?

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:03.160
Little lion...

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:05.050
we're your friends!

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:07.780
Fuwari!

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:10.670
We're your friends!

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:14.140
And...

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:15.940
we love you!

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:23.450
The lion's head-over-heels for her!

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:28.350
There, there, who's a good girl?

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:32.010
I–Incredible...

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:34.970
Do you like this?

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:38.890
Oh, little lion, your belly is so fluffy!

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:44.700
Hey, wanna come to my place later?

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:45.480
Sure!

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:51.770
<i>It'll be fine. Just have faith in us PriPara idols.</i>

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:53.440
<i>We'll perform here, no matter what!</i>

00:14:55.230 --> 00:14:56.010
Okay!

00:14:56.570 --> 00:14:57.740
Come on, Amiya.

00:14:57.740 --> 00:14:59.000
Amiya-chan!

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:03.810
Hey, do you want to go to PriPara?

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:04.600
Huh?

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:07.010
She's <i>still</i> on about that?

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:09.220
Let's go and watch their show, Amiya-chan!

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:13.440
There's no way you could do a show in such a dangerous place.

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:14.640
Right, Amiya?

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:15.570
Y–Yeah...

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:20.040
Come on, Amiya-chan. We used to be such good friends!

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:22.650
That's... in the past.

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:25.780
PriPara's over already!

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:30.280
When you hurry up and realise that, we can go back to being friends!

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:33.640
Please, it's the last time I'll ask!

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:36.240
If it doesn't work out this time, I'll give it up!

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:40.910
Please, just come with me now-mba!

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:47.180
Little lion, you dropped your glasses.

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:50.100
Those are Meganii's glasses-pri.

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:52.370
So that's where they were-pri.

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:57.890
I've been looking for them ever since that lion stole them-pri.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:01.120
Sapanii's speaking again.

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:02.520
But that sentence ender...

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:03.690
"Pri"?

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:09.400
Indeed, who else but the mighty Mirei has drummed the pri-nciples of language back into them-pri!

00:16:09.930 --> 00:16:12.960
Little lion, you shouldn't take things that belong to others.

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:16.330
Trade glasses, you two.

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:27.920
Pri-engage the stage system!

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:35.470
Pana!

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:37.530
Ami!

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:45.890
Whoa, amazing!

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:48.290
See? Isn't PriPara wonderful?

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:50.250
Well, this isn't anything...

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:55.950
It's all clean and lovely!

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:57.850
What happened?

00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:59.660
Here, take some of these.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:01.600
There you go-pri!

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:06.400
Sophie!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:08.400
We're gonna perform at the Sapanna PriPara Town!

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:11.080
I'll see you soon.

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:15.320
Pushu...

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:38.770
See? See?

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:39.950
Amazing...

00:17:41.690 --> 00:17:42.560
It's wonderful!

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:43.490
So cool!

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:47.720
And we have one more show for you all!

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:51.340
There's no better for a Sapanna idol show-pri!

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:03.340
Scan the appro-pr-iate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:05.250
Starting the Coord Change.

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:10.540
The twin motifs of flowers and wings are a perfect fit for the natural Sapanna landscape-pri.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:12.740
The tree-patterned shoes are a key detail to the ensemble-pri!

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:15.220
Palps Flower Country Coord!

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:22.510
Making Drama, switch on!

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:28.090
Let's go!

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:44.640
A mysterious spring orchestra!

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:49.680
Cyalume Change!

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.340
Incredible!

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:32.830
I'm so glad I came to see the show!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:34.350
Thanks, Panana.

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:34.980
Yeah!

00:20:35.840 --> 00:20:37.080
Um, so...

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:38.280
Amiya-chan...

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:41.020
Will you snap with me?

00:20:41.020 --> 00:20:42.900
Yeah, of course!

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:47.720
That's so great.

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:50.180
This is what PriPara's all about!

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.390
Thanks a lot, Lala-chan!

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:57.710
No worries! Now you guys have to keep PriPara full of excitement!

00:20:57.710 --> 00:20:58.360
Sure!

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:03.200
I want to become an idol who can make friends with wild animals, just like Fuwari-chan!

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:05.170
I'll cheer you on, then.

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:06.570
I'm sure you can do it!

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:08.480
Um, so, Mirei-san.

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:13.850
I–I'm really glad I got to meet you today.

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:16.670
I'll make today a Mirei-san Anniversary!

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:21.800
Ah! I... I see...

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:26.540
Greetings.

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:30.280
You want me to send a private jet to the Aprican Sapanna PriPara?

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:33.840
Yes, please! We can get home real quick if we borrow a jet–

00:21:33.840 --> 00:21:36.290
Why on earth should I do such a thing?

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:39.060
Oh, please? You're the only one we can ask, Hibiki-san.

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:42.030
It's your only recourse?

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:42.900
It is!

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:46.110
Oh, you're a lifesaver, Hibiki-san!

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:46.950
Thank you!

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:50.020
I see she really can tame any wild creature.

00:21:50.020 --> 00:21:51.050
Yeah.

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:56.620
Bye-bye! See you later!

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:59.600
Asante!

00:21:59.600 --> 00:22:02.000
I'll come see you in Parajuku one day!

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:04.250
Mirei-san!

00:22:05.560 --> 00:22:08.350
The Sapanna PriPara was a lot of fun –

00:22:08.350 --> 00:22:09.760
right, Sophie?

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:10.360
Hm?

00:22:13.920 --> 00:22:15.430
Pushu...

00:23:51.620 --> 00:23:53.280
If you're talking summer, it's gotta be the pool!

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:54.860
If you're talking idols, it's gotta be swimsuits!

00:23:54.860 --> 00:23:55.840
And with that...

00:23:55.840 --> 00:23:57.610
We're holding a swim meet!

00:23:57.610 --> 00:24:00.890
She who moves first wins!
Our victory will be a tremendous splash!

00:24:00.890 --> 00:24:02.650
You're a bit <i>too</i> fired up-pri.

00:24:02.650 --> 00:24:04.350
You've gotta have fun after all-pri!

00:24:04.350 --> 00:24:09.080
Unpreparedness is one's greatest enemy!
While you languish, we shall strike first and claim victory!

00:24:09.080 --> 00:24:11.500
If you think that, you're sauce-ly mistaken-pri!

00:24:11.500 --> 00:24:13.610
A pop and a step and we'll triumph-pri!

00:24:13.900 --> 00:24:17.020
Next time, <i>Swim Meet-pri! </i>Go<i>!</i>

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:19.980
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
